	(text "RJ45 J1  --  shielded 8P8C, T568B pinout\n  Pin 1: SDA        (pair 2, white/orange)\n  Pin 2: SCL        (pair 2, orange)\n  Pin 3: MBL_A_P    (pair 3, white/green)\n  Pin 4: +5V        (pair 1, blue)\n  Pin 5: GND        (pair 1, white/blue)\n  Pin 6: MBL_A_N    (pair 3, green)\n  Pin 7: MBL_B_P    (pair 4, white/brown)\n  Pin 8: MBL_B_N    (pair 4, brown)\nCable shield: chassis GND at PCB end only (single-point)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 30.226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "40000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "Future control functions (not yet designed):\n  - Filament supply on/off relay drive + panel LED\n  - HV supply on/off relay drive + panel LED\n  - T/R relay drive to protect receiver during TX\n  - Additional front-panel indicators / interlocks"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
